                <pb facs="0824" n="738" xml:id="pg738"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-09"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman reports that, judging from the tenor of an interview he has just
                    had at the Porte, he is inclined to believe that a few days’ more patience may
                    bring about the desired result.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
